  "body": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.tw93.fun/pic/cole.png\" alt=\"Mole Logo\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" style=\"border-radius:50%\" />\n  <h1 style=\"margin: 12px 0 6px;\">Mole</h1>\n  <p><em>Deep clean and optimize your Mac.</em></p>\n</div>\n\n### Changelog\n\n1. **Clean no longer goes quiet**: After App leftovers, `mo clean` keeps a \"Checking orphaned system services...\" line moving while it rechecks each service, and the Homebrew previews and Apps & utilities now show loading instead of a still screen.\n2. **Trash says why it was skipped**: When your terminal lacks Full Disk Access, `mo clean` prints one line saying so instead of leaving the Trash untouched without a word, and granting that access lets it empty the Trash again.\n3. **Uninstall loading keeps moving**: On a first scan, the \"Preparing app list...\" spinner keeps turning until the app list appears.\n\n### 更新日志\n\n1. **清理时不再静止不动**：App leftovers 之后逐个复查孤儿系统服务时，会一直显示 \"Checking orphaned system services...\"，Homebrew 预览和 Apps & utilities 这两段也都有 loading，不会再一停好几秒没有任何动静。\n2. **废纸篓没清会说明原因**：终端没有完全磁盘访问权限时，`mo clean` 会用一行提示说出来，不再一声不响地跳过废纸篓，给终端开了这个权限后就会照常清空。\n3. **卸载时的 loading 会一直转**：第一次扫描时，\"Preparing app list...\" 会一直转到 App 列表出来。\n\n### Mole Mac App\n\nIf you would rather work in a window than a terminal, [Mole Mac App](https://mole.fit/) covers cleaning, app removal, maintenance, disk analysis and live status, shows everything before it deletes, and adds tools in the menu bar. It costs $19 once, with free updates and a 14-day refund, and you can [download it here](https://mole.fit/download). The CLI stays free and open source.\n",
